      "parameters": {
        "content": "## BookYourSlot schedulers\n\nFour independent chains. Nothing connects them; that is intentional.\n\n**Before this will do anything:**\n\n1. Create a credential of type **Header Auth**\n   - Name: `Authorization`\n   - Value: the CRON_API_KEY from\n     `/opt/bookyourslot/deploy/production/.env`\n   - No `Bearer` prefix. The route compares the\n     header to the key exactly.\n2. Select it on all four HTTP Request nodes.\n3. **Activate** the workflow. Schedule triggers do\n   not run while it is inactive.\n\n**The key is deliberately not in this file.**\nImport shows `REPLACE_ME`; pick your credential.\n\n**Do not change the 10 minute cadence** on the 30m\nchain. Its band is 30 minutes wide and an hourly\nrun would skip most bookings entirely.\n\nWindows are decided by the app, not here. Each URL\nnames its band with `?window=`. An unrecognised\nvalue is rejected with 400 rather than silently\nfalling back, so a typo fails loudly.\n\nExpected response: `{\"window\":\"24h\",\"sent\":0,\n\"skipped\":0,\"failed\":0,\"considered\":0}`.\nA 401 means the credential is wrong.",
        "height": 1180,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "note-Setup",
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-300, -40]
    }
  ],
